#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7font.xml:104
#, xml-text
msgid "Downloading Xorg Fonts"
msgstr "Baixando as Fontes do Xorg"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7font.xml:107
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"First, create a list of files to be downloaded. This file will also be used "
"to verify the integrity of the downloads when complete:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, crie uma lista de arquivos a serem transferidos. Esse arquivo "
"também será usado para verificar a integridade das transferências quando "
"concluídas:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7font.xml:111
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; font-&xorg-version;.md5 &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>&font-util-md5sum;  font-util-&font-util-version;.tar.xz\n"
"&encodings-md5sum;  encodings-&encodings-version;.tar.xz\n"
"&font-alias-md5sum;  font-alias-&font-alias-version;.tar.xz\n"
"&font-adobe-utopia-type1-md5sum;  font-adobe-utopia-type1-&font-adobe-utopia-type1-version;.tar.xz\n"
"&font-bh-ttf-md5sum;  font-bh-ttf-&font-bh-ttf-version;.tar.xz\n"
"&font-bh-type1-md5sum;  font-bh-type1-&font-bh-type1-version;.tar.xz\n"
"&font-ibm-type1-md5sum;  font-ibm-type1-&font-ibm-type1-version;.tar.xz\n"
"&font-misc-ethiopic-md5sum;  font-misc-ethiopic-&font-misc-ethiopic-version;.tar.xz\n"
"&font-xfree86-type1-md5sum;  font-xfree86-type1-&font-xfree86-type1-version;.tar.xz</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; font-&xorg-version;.md5 &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>&font-util-md5sum;  font-util-&font-util-version;.tar.xz\n"
"&encodings-md5sum;  encodings-&encodings-version;.tar.xz\n"
"&font-alias-md5sum;  font-alias-&font-alias-version;.tar.xz\n"
"&font-adobe-utopia-type1-md5sum;  font-adobe-utopia-type1-&font-adobe-utopia-type1-version;.tar.xz\n"
"&font-bh-ttf-md5sum;  font-bh-ttf-&font-bh-ttf-version;.tar.xz\n"
"&font-bh-type1-md5sum;  font-bh-type1-&font-bh-type1-version;.tar.xz\n"
"&font-ibm-type1-md5sum;  font-ibm-type1-&font-ibm-type1-version;.tar.xz\n"
"&font-misc-ethiopic-md5sum;  font-misc-ethiopic-&font-misc-ethiopic-version;.tar.xz\n"
"&font-xfree86-type1-md5sum;  font-xfree86-type1-&font-xfree86-type1-version;.tar.xz</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7font.xml:124
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To download the needed files using <xref linkend='wget'/>, use the following"
" commands:"
msgstr ""
"Para baixar os arquivos necessários usando o <xref linkend='wget'/>, use os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7font.xml:128
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir font &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd font &amp;&amp;\n"
"grep -v '^#' ../font-&xorg-version;.md5 | awk '{print $2}' | wget -i- -c \\\n"
"    -B &xorg-download-http;/font/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"md5sum -c ../font-&xorg-version;.md5</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir font &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd font &amp;&amp;\n"
"grep -v '^#' ../font-&xorg-version;.md5 | awk '{print $2}' | wget -i- -c \\\n"
"    -B &xorg-download-http;/font/ &amp;&amp;\n"
"md5sum -c ../font-&xorg-version;.md5</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7font.xml:137
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Xorg Fonts"
msgstr "Instalação das Fontes do Xorg"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7font.xml:142
#, xml-text
msgid "First, start a subshell that will exit on error:"
msgstr "Primeiro, inicie um sub &quot;shell&quot; que sairá em caso de erro:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7font.xml:145
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>bash -e</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>bash -e</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7font.xml:148
#, xml-text
msgid "Install all of the packages by running the following commands:"
msgstr "Instale todos os pacotes executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7font.xml:151
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>for package in $(grep -v '^#' ../font-&xorg-version;.md5 | awk '{print $2}')\n"
"do\n"
"  packagedir=${package%.tar.?z*}\n"
"  tar -xf $package\n"
"  pushd $packagedir\n"
"    ./configure $XORG_CONFIG\n"
"    make\n"
"    as_root make install\n"
"  popd\n"
"  as_root rm -rf $packagedir\n"
"done</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>for package in $(grep -v '^#' ../font-&xorg-version;.md5 | awk '{print $2}')\n"
"do\n"
"  packagedir=${package%.tar.?z*}\n"
"  tar -xf $package\n"
"  pushd $packagedir\n"
"    ./configure $XORG_CONFIG\n"
"    make\n"
"    as_root make install\n"
"  popd\n"
"  as_root rm -rf $packagedir\n"
"done</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7font.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid "Finally, exit the shell that was started earlier:"
msgstr "Finalmente, saia do &quot;shell&quot; que foi iniciado anteriormente:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7font.xml:167
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>exit</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>exit</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7font.xml:170
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"When all of the fonts have been installed, the system must be configured so "
"that <application>Fontconfig</application> can find the TrueType fonts. "
"Since the fonts are outside of the default search path of several packages "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">if <envar>XORG_PREFIX</envar> is not <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename></emphasis>, make symlinks to the "
"<application>Xorg</application> TrueType font directories in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/share/fonts</filename> by running the following "
"commands as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Quando todas as fontes tiverem sido instaladas, o sistema precisará ser "
"configurado de forma que o &quot;<application>Fontconfig</application>&quot;"
" consiga encontrar as fontes &quot;TrueType&quot;. Como as fontes estão fora"
" do caminho padrão de pesquisa de vários pacotes <emphasis role=\"bold\">se "
"o &quot;<envar>XORG_PREFIX</envar>&quot; não for &quot;<filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr</filename>&quot;</emphasis>, [então] crie links "
"simbólicos para os diretórios de fontes &quot;TrueType&quot; do "
"&quot;<application>Xorg</application>&quot; em &quot;<filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/share/fonts</filename>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/x7font.xml:181
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -d -m755 /usr/share/fonts                               &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -svfn $XORG_PREFIX/share/fonts/X11/OTF /usr/share/fonts/X11-OTF &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -svfn $XORG_PREFIX/share/fonts/X11/TTF /usr/share/fonts/X11-TTF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -d -m755 /usr/share/fonts                              &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -svfn $XORG_PREFIX/share/fonts/X11/OTF /usr/share/fonts/X11-OTF &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -svfn $XORG_PREFIX/share/fonts/X11/TTF /usr/share/fonts/X11-TTF</userinput>"

